{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/1246520-how-plausible-are-high-humanity-dragons","id":1246520,"title":"How plausible are high humanity Dragons?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Vampire: The Requiem"],"posts":[{"date":"2018-08-15T19:51:41-07:00","id":1246520,"title":"How plausible are high humanity Dragons?","content":"how workable or unworkable is a high humanity member of the Ordo Dracul?<br /> <br /> while the Coils don't Cap humanity like Cruac, engaging in research related to them can degrade humanity something fierce.<br /> <br /> Thoughts?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/2iw20supportergarou125p\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/0j5hz8j\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/i/idnSdTJkj\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://i.imgsafe.org/97fd805379.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1153-prince-of-the-night","name":"Prince of the Night","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4205"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-08-15T21:06:21-07:00","id":1246530,"title":"","content":"I personally consider a high Humanity Cruac user to be more believable than a high Humanity Dragon. You can only bane out a few activities (which incidentally requires initial Humanity loss), and as you\u2019ve noted, there are far too many activities that are very low on the Humanity scale that Dragons have to engage in routinely for purposes of advancement that the developers have to create numerous special exemption from Humanity loss for specific activities and an entire Mystery that revolves around cheating the Humanity system in order for them to play them for any length of time as the unregenerate bastards the fiction portrays them.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5466-tsusasi","name":"tsusasi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5466_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1028"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-08-15T21:11:34-07:00","id":1246532,"title":"","content":"They're about as disinterested in Humanity as an organization as anyone else is-they just wear it more openly.<br /> <br /> Conversely, individual Dragons are just as prone to valuing Humanity as anyone else, within the frame of the context of seeking ot become a better class of monster.<br /> <br /> In short, it's just as plausible as with any of the other covenants, but that Humanity would have a clear relationship to what the Ordo's idea of a better class of monster means. Either that or they're are taking a necessary break from their pursuits, perhaps.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-08-16T05:20:49-07:00","id":1246607,"title":"","content":"Hmmmn think its reasonable for researchers to be amongst those who lear Coil of the Ziva?<br /> <br /> because I don't think a bane would help you for doing research on scales<br /> <br /> on an embrace modified by coil of the Voivode.s 5th dot?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/2iw20supportergarou125p\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/0j5hz8j\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/i/idnSdTJkj\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://i.imgsafe.org/97fd805379.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1153-prince-of-the-night","name":"Prince of the Night","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4205"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-08-16T06:55:08-07:00","id":1246637,"title":"","content":"<span style=\"font-size:14px\">Even tough i view the Ordo Dracul at large as a conglomerate of evil</span><span style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#222222\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">\u2122 with mengelesque scientists working on horrible unethical experiments that would scare even Unit 731. There is room in the Ordo Dracul for 'normal' pseudo-science. There's nothing inhuman with feng-shui and astrology and/or using your own body as a conduit of occult energies (well not very much inhuman compared to other experiments). So, even without banes you could make a workable and achievement focused dragon with both status and coils that do not involve himself with the inhumane and inhuman experiments the order is known for. </span></span></span>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/523-poseur","name":"Poseur","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar523_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"375"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-08-16T14:06:26-07:00","id":1246738,"title":"","content":"It's probably not a coincidence that the two covenants with proprietary powers that directly contribute to loss of Humanity and a commensurate disdain for the trait are simultaneously the least populous and the least likely to be in power in any given city compared to their more secrecy-humanity-and-polity-oriented fellows in the Movement and the Estates.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms\"><span style=\"color:#4B0082\"><b>Resident Lore-Hound</b></span><br /> Currently Consuming: <i>Demon: the Descent 1e</i></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/111-satchel","name":"Satchel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar111_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9828"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-08-16T15:29:21-07:00","id":1246782,"title":"","content":"you mean ordo Dracul and Circle of the crone just to make sure?<br /> <br /> belials brood feels neglected.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/2iw20supportergarou125p\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/0j5hz8j\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/i/idnSdTJkj\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://i.imgsafe.org/97fd805379.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1153-prince-of-the-night","name":"Prince of the Night","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4205"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-08-16T15:31:02-07:00","id":1246783,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Prince of the Night</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/1246520-how-plausible-are-high-humanity-dragons?p=1246782#post1246782\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">you mean ordo Dracul and Circle of the crone just to make sure?</div> </div> </div> </div>Those are the ones, yes.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms\"><span style=\"color:#4B0082\"><b>Resident Lore-Hound</b></span><br /> Currently Consuming: <i>Demon: the Descent 1e</i></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/111-satchel","name":"Satchel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar111_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9828"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-08-16T16:30:15-07:00","id":1246804,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Prince of the Night</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/1246520-how-plausible-are-high-humanity-dragons?p=1246607#post1246607\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Hmmmn think its reasonable for researchers to be amongst those who lear Coil of the Ziva?</div> </div> </div> </div> \u200bCoil of Ziva is pretty much all about high humanity Dragons<br /> <br /> Buttress the Soul<br /> When facing Detachment, she may spend Vitae, up to her normal per-turn limit. Every Vitae spent adds one die to resist Detachment.<br /> <br /> Enliven the Anima<br /> Any time she\u2019d suffer a Condition for Detachment, you may choose to spend a Willpower point to take Raptured instead.<br /> <br /> Bleed the Sin<br /> Reduce the subject\u2019s next Humanity, Integrity, or similar trait purchase by one Experience per dot of the vampire\u2019s Coil of Ziva. (I'm pretty sure that should be beats rather than Experience)<br /> <br /> Siphon the Soul<br /> Steal humanity from other vampires<br /> <br /> <br /> If you also have the 5th dot of Mystery of the Voivode (The Vast Dynasty) then you can do stuff like sire a vampire and pump the degeneration roll with &quot;Buttress the Soul&quot; so you don't lose humanity, if you don't get an Exceptional Success you can use &quot;Enliven the Anima&quot; so you get Raptured instead of Bestial, Competitive, or Wanton, then use &quot;Siphon the Soul&quot; on the new Vampire, plus &quot;Buttress the Soul&quot; and &quot;Enliven the Anima&quot; so you don't lose humanity for this. Once your pool is high enough, you'll gain Humanity faster than you lose it, and can maintain a permanent humanity 10 while being a complete monster.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/299-ninedaysdead","name":"NineDaysDead","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"188"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-08-16T17:01:38-07:00","id":1246814,"title":"","content":"despite my concerns on Coil of the Ascendant<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/1207717-coil-of-the-ascendant-hows-it-seen-by-outsiders\">http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/m...n-by-outsiders</a><br /> <br /> I think the Amanotsukai at least would be interested in Bleed the sin, as it lets them try to improve a Vampire or mortals mental stability.<br /> <br /> And they and the Bak-Ra would probably be more tolerant of &quot;Shedding the Beasts skin&quot; then of &quot;Sun's Forgotten kiss&quot; <br /> <br /> Since its evading rather then defying the divine curse on their kindred Nature.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/2iw20supportergarou125p\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/0j5hz8j\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/i/idnSdTJkj\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://i.imgsafe.org/97fd805379.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":1153,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1153-prince-of-the-night","user":"Prince of the Night","date":". 08-16-2018, 08:03 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1153-prince-of-the-night","name":"Prince of the Night","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4205"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}